WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:08.000
<i>The night before our final stage performance of "Swan Lake,"</i>

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.010
<i>what saved me, when I was still puzzled and
felt like there was something left behind</i>

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.300
<i>were Layla-san's words.</i>

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:20.100
If you feel like there's something left behind,

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:25.980
then that only means that you can create an
even more amazing and wonderful show.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.860
It's proof of that fact.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.230
An even more amazing stage...

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:33.610
Yes. Even after this performance ends,

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:39.870
as long as you still have those feelings, a long,
long path will continue to extend before you.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:46.230
We all are always looking forward to your next performance, Sora.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:49.980
And if those are our hopes, then you'll surely be able to fulfill them.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.500
Yes!

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:54.510
<i>Layla-san is a phoenix.</i>

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:59.510
<i>Those words of hers will always passionately burn me to the core.</i>

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:04.210
<i>And, in the next performance, I too will become a phoenix!</i>

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:14.340
Hi10Anime

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:14.340
Hi10Anime

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:25.830
Yeah! Try to shake it even further back and forth there!

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:27.000
Okay!

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:42.510
<i>Because the place where light and shadow waver back and forth</i>

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:42.510
<i>yureugoku hikari to kage ga afureru basho ga</i>

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.210
Mia-san, what should we do with the lighting at this part?

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.500
Sorry... could you let me think about it a little while longer?

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.420
So, do you think we'll be able to put together a new feat, May?

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.800
I've already made it!

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.390
The name only, that is!

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:40.680
The name only?

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:43.060
One, two! One, two!

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:48.310
<i>is calling me,</i>

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:48.310
<i>watashi wo yonderu kara</i>

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:44.560
And right there, stretch out forward!

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:45.680
One, two!

00:01:49.850 --> 00:02:06.450
<i>I have to go. If you listen carefully, you'll surely be able to hear it too.</i>

00:01:49.850 --> 00:02:06.450
<i>ikanakucha mimi wo sumaseba kikoeru deshou</i>

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:52.060
Er... how's this then?

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:53.820
You can do it, Anna-san!

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:56.760
Are you all right?

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:01.200
Wearing the costume of a princess... it's so embarrassing!

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:18.010
<i>The applause is the gravity that won't let me go.</i>

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:18.010
<i>kassai wa watashi wo hanasanai inryoku</i>

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:32.590
<i>I'll continue to walk forward without fear,</i>

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:32.590
<i>osorezu ni susunde yukou</i>

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:43.410
<i>no matter how steep the path may be.</i>

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:43.410
<i>donna ni kewashii michi da to shitemo</i>

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:47.950
Amazing...

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:56.550
<i>Even my tears will change into diamonds.</i>

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:56.550
<i>namida sae daiyamondo ni kaeru</i>

00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:11.140
<i>I wish on a shooting star that I gain such strength.</i>

00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:11.140
<i>sonna chikara wo ataete to ryuusei ni negau</i>

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:18.650
Magnificent! You were truly the phoenix itself!

00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:20.530
I was so moved by your performance!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:22.650
It's a complete success, Layla-san!

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:36.790
I don't know about this...

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:41.220
Will the curtains on the opening day rise
with that performance as it is now?

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:45.340
If they dare let that happen, then I'll step off the stage.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.810
Miss... Layla-san!

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:53.520
If I can be of assistance to you in any way, please tell me!

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:55.980
Thank you.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:58.460
But I'm fine. Please let me be alone.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:01.090
Yes...

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:07.010
<i>I truly am wishing to perform as the phoenix...</i>

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:12.020
<i>But it's meaningless if I'm not the reborn Layla Hamilton!</i>

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:15.730
<i>If I can't do that much, then I can't call it the real phoenix!</i>

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:24.820
It's wrong... with the way this is right now, I can't call it the phoenix...

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:30.060
How goes things? Is it difficult?

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.850
Yeah... it is.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:34.730
But no matter what happens, I have
to see this through to the very end!

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:38.020
Especially since I was the one who said I wanted to play the phoenix.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:39.570
Give it all you've got, Sora.

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:42.070
Thanks to the long run of "Swan Lake," when anyone says your name,

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:45.780
the image of your Odette from it, is fixed in everyone's heads.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:49.410
In order to surpass that and appeal as the new you,

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.270
I really think this is the most ideal theme you could've picked.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:52.700
Yeah!

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:57.830
I'll surely find a new me in this performance! I will, I will!

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.130
But at any rate, it sure is a mysterious coincidence

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:05.200
that both you and Layla-san happen to be performing
the same phoenix at the same time.

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:06.220
Yeah.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:11.310
When I think of how I'll be compared to Cathy-san,
the pressure is overwhelming...

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:13.290
You'll be fine, Mia!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:14.500
I wonder about that...

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:17.810
I'm sure of it. After all, everyone thinks the script is pretty interesting!

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.360
Really?!

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:21.820
<i>The problem is with me...</i>

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:24.360
<i>I haven't grasped a hold of my own phoenix yet...</i>

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:25.130
Sora, are you there?

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:26.570
Ah, yes!

00:05:26.570 --> 00:05:29.570
There's big trouble! Layla escaped!

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:30.870
Escaped?!

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:33.040
Er... she's not a caged animal, you know.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:37.370
And well, I was asked to see if you'd heard
anything from her at all about it?

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:38.920
Ah, no, I haven't...

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:42.630
If I recall correctly, there's only a little less than
 two weeks left before her opening day...

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:47.380
I wonder if there are times where Layla gets caught
by the pressure and wants to run away?

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:50.300
<i>I can't think of Layla-san as one to ever do something like that...</i>

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.760
<i>But then, why did she...?</i>

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:59.600
Leo is sinking in the haze of hesitation about it...

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:05.110
And Sagittarius is also, once again, lost within a deep haze.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:11.620
Does that mean I can't be of any help to her?

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:14.030
I... cannot say.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.350
Are you going to go?

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:16.960
To New York, that is.

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:19.670
Right now, my feelings are telling me to go right away, but...

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:23.630
You can leave Rosetta and me to watch after
things! You have nothing to worry about!

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:26.170
That's what I'm worried about the most!

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:28.300
It's just as Fool-sensei said!

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.070
Yeah!

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.070
Never!

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:33.800
If it's just my and Marion's "new face
performance" you're worried about,

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:35.450
I'll show you we can do it fine!

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.390
Seeeee! Nothing to worry about.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.810
Ah! Sora, wait!

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:45.110
I figured it would turn out like this, so
 I spoke to the owner a little earlier.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:46.260
There's not one bit of space in here!

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:46.260
Thanks.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:49.030
Ken, I'll leave Sora with you.

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:49.650
Yep.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.030
It'd be great if Layla-san's fine and all.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:53.550
Don't worry you two! I'll be back in no time!

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:57.370
Sora, I'm worried about Layla-san and all too,

00:06:57.370 --> 00:07:00.500
but don't forget your own performance is also closing in.

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.620
But if it's you, things should be fine, right?

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:03.730
Yeah!

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:07.500
Have a safe trip!

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:12.990
I thought you'd totally be against me going to see Layla-san

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:17.080
when I haven't even grasped hold of my own phoenix yet.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:21.080
If you were going to try and use Layla-san as support, then I would.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:26.770
But right now, your feelings are facing
 straight ahead, so I think you'll be fine.

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:27.460
Yeah.

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.880
<i>Yes...</i>

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:33.410
<i>I was always relying on Layla-san...</i>

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:40.330
<i>No matter what the time was, Layla-san would always
be standing far beyond me, and guide me.</i>

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:43.000
<i>The always strong Layla-san...</i>

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:49.420
<i>But, right now, there's a Layla-san I don't know in New York.</i>

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.760
<i>I wonder what happened...</i>

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:59.060
What are you doing, trying to go to
where Layla-san is all by yourself?!

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:00.520
Ah, May, are you coming too?

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:02.310
Of course I am!

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:05.540
I can't just stay put when Layla-san's in serious trouble!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:06.040
Yes...

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:07.710
Geez!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:10.170
Here you go. Keep the change.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:11.690
Come on, move!

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:12.780
What?!

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:12.780
M-M-M-May!

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:14.530
What's your problem?! I'm just switching to your cab!

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:15.160
It's dangerous!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.660
The taxi fare would be a waste if we both took different ones!

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:20.490
Miracle Taxi Change!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.640
Good boys and girls will ABSOLUTELY NOT mimic this!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.640
Good boys and girls will ABSOLUTELY NOT mimic this!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.620
Come on, come on! Hurry it up!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.250
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.630
Can't this thing go any faster?!

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:32.420
Calm down, May!

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.020
You alone?

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:51.860
I'm Liu.

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:54.180
I'm Layla.

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:58.530
From what I saw back there, it looks like
 you're not used to traveling by bike.

00:08:58.530 --> 00:08:59.910
Any reason for it?

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:01.410
Oh, if you don't want to say, that's all right.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:05.750
Since it was supposed to be a journey alone,
 let's both just not worry about each other.

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:09.250
But hey, could it be you didn't prepare anything to eat?

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:10.000
Yeah...

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:13.690
As I thought! From looking at you before, you seemed
 the type where you'd just caught a jet plane

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:16.470
out of self-admonishment on a journey to find yourself
or whatever, and it really was that way!

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:21.350
It doesn't seem like there'll be any restaurants
along the way from here on until Binghamton.

00:09:21.350 --> 00:09:22.680
I don't really mind.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.560
Ah, did I make you mad? Sorry.

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:28.600
We're supposed to not be worrying about each other,
 aren't we? There's nothing to apologize for.

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:32.690
You're pretty different.

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:34.820
I've brought my own oven along, so have something to eat.

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:35.820
Thank you.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:36.930
Five bucks'll be fine.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:39.800
One dollar for as much coffee as you want to drink.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.510
I also have some beer for 50 cents, if you'd prefer that.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:49.920
I thought you weren't a normal person, and boy was I right...

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.380
Are you going to sleep here tonight?

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:52.290
Yeah.

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:55.050
Then, would it be all right for me to do the same?

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:56.170
Feel free.

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:02.240
<i>Liu... I haven't met a person like her before.</i>

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.200
<i>Come to think of it, Sora was the same...</i>

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:11.650
<i>When I first met her, she was the type of newcomer
 that has such large dreams, but no talent at all...</i>

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:15.280
<i>I thought to myself that I couldn't forgive her naivete.</i>

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:17.570
<i>But I was wrong.</i>

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:22.160
<i>Sora was just a type of person that I had not known before.</i>

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:26.680
<i>Having met Sora, I changed.</i>

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.210
<i>I found a new me.</i>

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:39.720
<i>A new me, huh?</i>

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:44.760
<i>I'm trying to rely on someone...</i>

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:47.000
<i>I am?</i>

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:48.810
<i>Impossible.</i>

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:53.980
Hey!

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:54.980
Hello!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.380
Hello!

00:10:57.900 --> 00:11:02.200
We have drip, siphoned, and coffee maker coffee.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.620
Which would you all prefer?

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.030
Whichever of them is fastest.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:07.390
So then, Layla-san left by bike?

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.250
Yes, most likely.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:12.000
All she left in her memo was to please watch after this room.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.000
Where could she have gone?

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:17.400
We've received some information that
said she headed north of here, but...

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.130
Besides that nothing...

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:21.320
She must be struggling over something.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:24.720
Though, on the other hand, I'm a little relieved by this little affair

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:27.870
Knowing that even Layla Hamilton has a weakness to her.

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:35.290
As I was told by my mother, who worked for the Hamilton
family at the time, I became Layla-san's playmate, but...

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:38.690
At the time, she was a crybaby.

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:46.350
Miss, this is my daughter, Macquarie.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.350
If you'd like, please play with her.

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.330
Now, go on and cheer her up.

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:55.170
Y-Yeah...

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:07.200
Mother... Mother!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:11.210
If you don't hurry and get released from here, I'll be too sad!

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:14.600
I wonder if she changed after her mother passed away?

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:18.820
I don't know exactly know what happened
right before she passed away,

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:22.990
but on the day of her funeral, she didn't cry one tear.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:33.000
I can't sleep...

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:46.220
Noooo!

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:47.760
My money was stolen...

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:50.060
Hey! What am I supposed to do?!

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:52.180
For now, let's bike to Binghamton.

00:12:52.180 --> 00:12:54.180
We can figure things out there.

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:59.360
I'll give you a job.

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:05.280
Come one to see, come all to see!

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:08.450
The miraculous bike acrobatics are about to start!

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:31.510
She's amazing...

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.680
Hey, isn't that Layla Hamilton?

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:35.850
Ah, it is her! It's Layla!

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:36.520
As expected!

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:38.440
She was a celebrity?

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:39.730
Almost forgot...!

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.520
Thank you! Thank you!

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:46.200
Incredible!

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:46.760
Ow!

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:51.120
Sorry for taking this much.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:52.950
It's a fair payment.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.330
So you really were a great celebrity, huh?

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:00.330
I'm so envious that you can earn so much from just your name.

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:02.670
Where are you headed to now?

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:04.210
I don't know.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:05.820
But let's part here.

00:14:07.130 --> 00:14:08.820
I don't mind...

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:12.220
At this rate, it feels like there'll be reliance involved...

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:13.390
From both of us.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:17.480
Then, let's meet up again somewhere else later.

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:19.770
If you exert yourself too much, your body won't be able to take it.

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:22.480
I told you to exert yourself more when driving!

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:23.480
Just do this!

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.760
Layla-san!

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:33.010
Ken, are you all right?

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:35.220
Geez, he's so pathetic!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:39.120
May, just because you're over-hyped about this
doesn't mean we'll find her just like that.

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:40.370
Well, sorry...

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:46.920
But, there's no guarantee we'll find her just
 because we're hoping so much we will.

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:50.970
Sora.

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:52.010
What is it?

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:56.560
If it were you, which way would you
 go? A mountain road or a level one?

00:14:57.980 --> 00:15:03.020
If I ran out troubled by something, I don't think I'd take the easy way...

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:06.070
That's what I thought. She might not be down this road.

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:09.400
Let's try taking Route 17 West.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:18.750
<i>To cling to someone...</i>

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:23.060
<i>Does that mean a weak self which does that was still inside of me?!</i>

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:27.000
If you two don't win, don't you dare come back here.

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:33.140
If you don't win at the Circus Festival, you
two will have no place to return to.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:39.480
Yuri, let's refine the Golden Phoenix.

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:43.150
For the finish, I'II be the one to grab the bar in the end.

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:46.650
Wait. It's too dangerous to make a change like that at this point.

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:48.320
It'd be much wiser to keep it the way it is where I catch yo--

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:49.650
It'll be fine.

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:51.700
If you're worried about practice, I've already done it quite a bit.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.950
Sorry about hiding it from you.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.510
I see...

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:01.620
<i>My goal was always to the me of the future.</i>

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:03.940
<i>I won't place a burden on anyone.</i>

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.980
I won't let myself disappoint anyone.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:14.680
I should've expected as much. Our win had already been certain.

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:15.930
Yes.

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:17.260
Already obvious, was it?

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:23.480
I pray that there'll be a newcomer this year
 that can really set your soul aflame.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:25.770
You're not going to join in the judging?

00:16:25.770 --> 00:16:29.530
I have no interest in anyone but Layla Hamilton.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:32.190
Was it this way?

00:16:33.360 --> 00:16:35.450
Excuse me...

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:37.320
Ah, thank goodness! This is the place!

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:38.870
Umm, you are...?

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:42.250
Sora! My name is Naegino Sora!

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:49.460
One day, I want my father to recognize the Kaleido Stage.

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:54.430
For that purpose, my shows must be perfect all the time.

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:59.010
For the climax of Arabian Nights, we'll have
a co-performance by Layla and Sora.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:03.250
Layla-san, I want to try it!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:06.150
If this is just some half-hearted preparation,
then you'll just be a burden!

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:09.400
<i>Why? Why Sora?</i>

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:14.030
<i>Why am I so taken in by her?</i>

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:21.600
<i>I thought there was no possible way that someone who could</i>

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:24.710
<i>make me burn up with excitement besides myself could appear...</i>

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:26.730
<i>But, Sora did.</i>

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:29.500
<i>And I had to change my way of thinking as such.</i>

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.210
<i>I see now...</i>

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:36.220
<i>I didn't find a new me.</i>

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:38.800
<i>I just changed.</i>

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:41.100
<i>Sora...</i>

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:46.600
Yes.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.270
All right, I understand.

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:49.310
Bye then.

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:53.610
It seems that Layla-san stopped at a service area in Binghamton.

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:54.610
Really?!

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:56.930
Bingo! It was a great success to have taken Route 17 this way!

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:59.450
Apparently she held a bike performance.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:04.450
Could it be this was a trip to perform special bike training...?

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:05.950
I don't think that's it...

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:05.950
I don't think that's it...

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.830
W-When did you?!

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:11.210
A journey is... a truly enjoyable experience, isn't it?

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:16.420
When we bathed last night, where were you?!

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:22.030
Don't grin like that... it couldn't be that you entered...

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.470
No way! You were in the bath?!

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:26.770
She's talking with the Spirit of the Stage... right?

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:28.170
You were there?! You were really in the bath?!

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:28.170
Probably...

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:31.270
Why is she only talking about the bath...?

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:31.270
Noo! You're the worst! You pervert!

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:34.360
Sora, I was joking! It was just a joke!

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:36.190
I didn't see a thing!

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:38.400
Ah, there's a bike up ahead!

00:18:36.190 --> 00:18:40.200
Ahh! I really didn't do anything!

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.200
Huh, Layla-san?!

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:43.870
Ah, I was with her up until a while hack.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:46.680
Really?! Really, really?

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.870
What? Are you looking for her?

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:49.620
Yes!

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.380
Do you know which way she went?

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:53.130
Sorry...

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.170
Is that so? It guess there's no helping it.

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:58.530
We'll have to go up a bit further then, huh?

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:01.720
Oh.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:06.310
I thought she was a pretty strong person, but that's the situation, huh?

00:19:06.310 --> 00:19:08.310
It was the first time I'd ever met a person like her.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:13.150
For someone like me who relies on
 people on the spot and vice versa,

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:14.730
and who uses people, and vice versa...

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:18.240
I can't imagine any other way of living.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:20.900
But, to me, she looked really cool.

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:22.320
To have that kind of strength.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:26.700
But in exchange, she's probably relentless
 when she comers in on herself.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:29.160
It looked like she was really pressing herself hard.

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:32.330
<i>For Layla-san to be struggling that much...</i>

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:34.840
<i>I want to help her, even if it's in the littlest possible way!</i>

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:39.920
<i>But, Layla-san is trying to overcome this by herself</i>

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:43.220
<i>I wonder if me doing this is all futile?</i>

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:45.640
Thank you very much.

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:48.060
Ah, if you meet up with her,

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:51.190
tell her that next time we meet, she
 can have some cup noodles for free.

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:40.610
<i>Rain, huh?</i>

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:42.320
<i>It makes me remember...</i>

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:47.950
<i>There was a raging storm on that day as well...</i>

00:20:50.200 --> 00:20:53.710
<i>Even though the upcoming performance was
to be the next day, we were that reckless...</i>

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:59.210
<i>If it were the previous me, I never would
have thought of doing such a thing.</i>

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:03.150
<i>But back then, to me, it was as if it was natural.</i>

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:06.390
<i>Sora has the power to change those around her.</i>

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:23.900
This week, we'll be filming outside the city, so I don't have much time.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.700
Yes, I've just finished researching.

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:28.950
It's a bit of a tight schedule, but if you take this flight,

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:32.870
you should at least be able to perform
in Marine Park's show for ten minutes.

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:41.130
How do you like it? I put it together myself.

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:43.760
Thank you. I'll be using it right away.

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:45.720
Yes!

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:48.680
<i>It was from that point...</i>

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:51.350
<i>that I was no longer hesitant of doing such reckless things.</i>

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:58.230
<i>Yes... I thought that not holding myself back anymore might be better.</i>

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:05.610
<i>And then, when I saw Fool for the first time and gained
the right to perform the Legendary Illusion,</i>

00:22:05.610 --> 00:22:11.200
<i>I didn't care what I had to do as long as
I could perform it together with Sora.</i>

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:40.980
<i>The Legendary Illusion...</i>

00:22:40.980 --> 00:22:46.780
<i>I injured my shoulder, and even if I would never be able
to stand onstage again, I wanted to pull through with it.</i>

00:22:48.070 --> 00:22:51.050
<i>For there to have been a feat that could push me that much...</i>

00:22:51.050 --> 00:22:53.600
<i>If I hadn't met Sora, I probably never would've learned of it.</i>

00:23:02.590 --> 00:23:06.210
I'm just remembering things that have already passed.

00:23:06.210 --> 00:23:09.260
This time, I can't see the me of the future to mark as my goal.

00:23:09.260 --> 00:23:12.970
Could this be... my limit?

00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:23.610
Is there no more road ahead for me to travel down?

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:30.570
We'll be in Rochester soon...

00:23:30.570 --> 00:23:33.910
Even if it's Layla-san we're talking about, I don't think she'd go this far.

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:36.310
I wonder if we went too far...

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:39.160
She must be stopped somewhere in this rain.

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:43.380
Let's also stop here for tonight and try going back
the way we came tomorrow to look for her.

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:46.170
Oh, there's a supermarket next door!

00:23:46.170 --> 00:23:48.710
Leave dinner up to me.

00:23:50.010 --> 00:23:53.240
Then you still haven't had any word back from
Cathy-san and the others about where she is?

00:23:53.240 --> 00:23:54.300
Yeah.

00:23:54.300 --> 00:23:57.850
There was just some information at a service
area from a person who ran into her.

00:23:57.850 --> 00:23:58.870
I see...

00:23:59.430 --> 00:24:01.350
I wonder what she's so troubled over...

00:24:01.350 --> 00:24:04.480
So even someone like Layla-san has some worries...

00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:07.820
For me, it's the days that I'm not troubled that are fewer.

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:10.670
That wasn't something to laugh about...

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:11.900
We re sorry!

00:24:12.450 --> 00:24:16.910
I want to become better at balancing on top of
a ball. I wonder if that'd be considered a worry?

00:24:16.910 --> 00:24:20.000
Marion, you're doing your best, so I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:24:23.330 --> 00:24:24.830
This is really becoming a problem...

00:24:25.380 --> 00:24:27.630
I'm sure Jonathan will be fine too!

00:24:28.510 --> 00:24:33.470
Whatever Layla-san's troubled over might be something
that I can't do anything about, but...

00:24:33.470 --> 00:24:35.050
Layla-san troubled over something...

00:24:35.050 --> 00:24:36.180
Yeah.

00:24:36.180 --> 00:24:39.490
I hope I can help her at least a little bit

00:24:41.020 --> 00:24:44.520
Because I was over-thinking things, I made too
much, so eat like you were about to die!

00:24:53.110 --> 00:24:55.070
Why do you two look like you're in such pain?!

00:24:55.070 --> 00:24:58.370
If you compare that to the amount of pain
Layla-san's gone through, this is nothing!

00:24:58.370 --> 00:24:59.910
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:25:05.250 --> 00:25:06.560
Hey...

00:25:07.130 --> 00:25:10.800
Do you really think Layla-san's really troubled over something?

00:25:10.800 --> 00:25:11.840
What do you mean?

00:25:13.050 --> 00:25:18.100
Do you think maybe she's doing some secret
training or something like that instead?

00:25:20.350 --> 00:25:26.560
I don't want to imagine Layla-san cornering
herself so much over just some worry...

00:25:26.560 --> 00:25:29.230
I want her to always stay as her strong self...

00:25:31.030 --> 00:25:35.010
Somewhere in my heart... I feel the same way.

00:25:35.010 --> 00:25:37.470
I want to say that Layla-san is different from us.

00:25:38.700 --> 00:25:44.200
But, we don't know everything there is to her...

00:25:44.210 --> 00:25:49.590
To perform the phoenix must be as
difficult as it sounds to her as well.

00:25:49.590 --> 00:25:50.920
Yeah...

00:25:51.800 --> 00:25:53.550
How about you?

00:25:53.550 --> 00:25:56.470
Do you think you'll be able to find your phoenix?

00:25:58.180 --> 00:26:00.470
Still feel like there's still a while to go, huh?

00:26:00.470 --> 00:26:01.350
Yeah...

00:26:02.310 --> 00:26:04.350
<i>A new me...</i>

00:26:04.350 --> 00:26:08.350
<i>Could it be that Layla-san's struggling over the same thing?</i>

00:26:08.360 --> 00:26:13.360
Leo is trapped within the deep darkness...

00:26:13.360 --> 00:26:16.930
If it cannot regain its previous shine, it will only vanish into it.

00:26:30.210 --> 00:26:31.860
Have you warmed up a little?

00:26:31.860 --> 00:26:34.070
Yes, thank you very much.

00:26:34.070 --> 00:26:35.530
You really surprised us.

00:26:35.550 --> 00:26:41.050
For a young, cute girl like yourself to be all alone out there in the rain.

00:26:41.680 --> 00:26:47.020
I don't know what happened, but even if you're
 pushing yourself hard, you need rest.

00:26:47.020 --> 00:26:49.810
Why don't you stay here tonight?

00:26:52.080 --> 00:26:55.030
I... ran away.

00:26:58.280 --> 00:27:03.330
If I remained the way I was there at Broadway, it
seemed like I would have to rely on someone.

00:27:04.330 --> 00:27:09.120
I didn't like seeing my weak self... and ran out.

00:27:10.080 --> 00:27:12.330
I apologize for speaking out loud to myself like that...

00:27:12.340 --> 00:27:13.750
It's all right.

00:27:13.750 --> 00:27:18.010
It looks like you have some trouble
we haven't the slightest clue about.

00:27:18.010 --> 00:27:21.680
And that you don't really like to rely on others.

00:27:21.680 --> 00:27:25.060
But, don't you think you're straining yourself a bit too far?

00:27:25.060 --> 00:27:30.710
There are some places in this world that you can't
reach or see without relying on someone else.

00:27:31.150 --> 00:27:33.480
If you'd like, would you talk to us about it?

00:27:35.730 --> 00:27:41.860
Of course, I m well aware of the fact that I've relied on
many people's strengths to get to where I am today.

00:27:41.870 --> 00:27:45.580
Even now, I'm in the care of you two.

00:27:45.580 --> 00:27:51.250
But... I don't want to have to rely on people.

00:27:51.250 --> 00:27:57.340
To have such a weakness where I can't move forward
without relying on someone else, like back then...

00:27:58.470 --> 00:28:03.720
Back then, when I vowed I would never cry again, I
had intended to throw that weakness away as well.

00:28:06.930 --> 00:28:10.600
My mother had been hospitalized for
six months before she passed away,

00:28:10.600 --> 00:28:14.830
and because I could hardly see her, I got very exasperated by it.

00:28:14.830 --> 00:28:17.270
You said you'd be released soon!

00:28:17.270 --> 00:28:21.030
I hate you! I hate you, Mother!

00:28:25.160 --> 00:28:26.910
You're right...

00:28:26.910 --> 00:28:31.620
I have to hurry and get better... and come home...

00:28:31.620 --> 00:28:36.000
If I don't, your tears will dry up...

00:28:36.000 --> 00:28:41.550
You liar! You said you'd come back home for my birthday!

00:28:41.550 --> 00:28:45.180
Say something, Mother!

00:28:45.180 --> 00:28:48.100
I'm sor...ry...

00:28:48.100 --> 00:28:52.230
Mother... you hate me, don't you?

00:28:52.230 --> 00:28:54.040
That's it, isn't it?

00:28:55.230 --> 00:28:58.860
After that, my mother's disease got worse day after day,

00:28:58.860 --> 00:29:01.110
and eventually we were no longer able
to speak to each other anymore.

00:29:01.490 --> 00:29:03.530
Mother, you...

00:29:04.450 --> 00:29:08.430
Mother, you don't have to return anymore!

00:29:08.430 --> 00:29:11.500
They say she won't last another week...

00:29:11.500 --> 00:29:16.000
Yes, but Miss Layla doesn't know that, right?

00:29:16.000 --> 00:29:17.630
How sad...

00:29:18.130 --> 00:29:18.730
Miss?!

00:29:20.300 --> 00:29:21.550
She heard us...

00:29:25.300 --> 00:29:28.970
When I had learned that my mother
wouldn't live for very much longer,

00:29:28.970 --> 00:29:32.600
That she was already in a vegetative state.

00:29:33.980 --> 00:29:38.440
No matter how much I apologized to her, no matter
 how much I screamed out my real feelings,

00:29:38.440 --> 00:29:42.260
it would never return a smile to her face.

00:29:42.460 --> 00:29:45.700
I regretted everything I'd done, but it was too late.

00:29:46.780 --> 00:29:52.160
That evening, when I couldn't fall asleep, I went to
my father's room, which is something I rarely did...

00:30:08.300 --> 00:30:15.100
Rola, it looks like there's nothing left that I can do for you...

00:30:15.100 --> 00:30:18.230
You're probably worried about Layla...

00:30:18.230 --> 00:30:22.520
Leaving Layla, who's such a crybaby that always clinged you...

00:30:22.530 --> 00:30:24.820
You must be regretting it so...

00:30:27.860 --> 00:30:31.200
I'll give her enough love for the both of us...

00:30:34.450 --> 00:30:38.210
My father never showed tears in front of my mother once...

00:30:39.000 --> 00:30:44.130
I thought he was cruel because of that, but it wasn't that way at all.

00:30:45.010 --> 00:30:47.760
It was because he was thinking of her,
so she would never become uneasy.

00:30:50.850 --> 00:30:57.430
I hated myself who relied only on my mother and who
yelled out all of my sad feelings to her all the time.

00:30:58.350 --> 00:31:00.230
I wanted to become stronger...

00:31:03.150 --> 00:31:07.820
"I'll never cry again." "I'll never sadden Father again."

00:31:07.820 --> 00:31:09.880
At that time, I vowed those two things.

00:31:10.570 --> 00:31:14.200
It must have been so difficult. I'm so sorry.

00:31:14.910 --> 00:31:18.710
But if that's the reason why you're at the end of your tether,

00:31:18.710 --> 00:31:23.710
it might be a good idea to return to the way you were back then.

00:31:24.630 --> 00:31:28.220
Yes. Its the fundamentals of journeying
that when you've taken the wrong path

00:31:28.220 --> 00:31:31.140
and gotten lost to go back to where you came from.

00:31:31.970 --> 00:31:36.430
To return... to the way I was back then?

00:31:39.940 --> 00:31:46.320
Even if you relied on her, I'm sure your
 mother never blamed you for it.

00:31:47.030 --> 00:31:50.740
Why don't you try releasing some of that stress you've collected?

00:31:59.120 --> 00:32:01.750
Because I was thinking about things again...

00:32:01.750 --> 00:32:03.630
Sorry, but do your best.

00:32:03.630 --> 00:32:04.440
Yeah.

00:32:07.880 --> 00:32:10.630
What's wrong? Worried about Layla?

00:32:10.630 --> 00:32:15.180
Or are you anxious about having not grasped your phoenix yet?

00:32:15.180 --> 00:32:16.660
Both.

00:32:16.660 --> 00:32:20.700
Liu-san did say Layla-san was pushing herself a lot, too.

00:32:20.700 --> 00:32:23.460
And I was just thinking it's not good to push yourself too hard.

00:32:23.460 --> 00:32:26.020
I told you I was thinking about things and made that much!

00:32:26.020 --> 00:32:28.780
Excuse me for pushing myself hard! You're
really persistent about some things, geez!

00:32:28.780 --> 00:32:29.900
Not that, not that!

00:32:29.900 --> 00:32:31.800
I'm not talking about breakfast.

00:32:31.800 --> 00:32:36.580
It's true that being reckless all the time
may not really be a good path...

00:32:36.580 --> 00:32:40.640
And though I don't really have any ideas for mine yet,

00:32:40.640 --> 00:32:43.600
I wonder if Layla-san hasn't gotten a hold of others yet...

00:32:55.550 --> 00:32:56.720
Really?!

00:32:56.720 --> 00:33:00.600
Yeah. Though I forgot to ask her name.

00:33:00.600 --> 00:33:02.600
But it's probably that person.

00:33:02.600 --> 00:33:04.140
Are you her friends?

00:33:04.150 --> 00:33:07.060
If you're looking for her, she headed off towards Seneca Lake.

00:33:07.610 --> 00:33:10.780
It'd be great if her troubles clear up soon.

00:34:04.120 --> 00:34:07.000
<i>The way I was... back then?</i>

00:34:10.800 --> 00:34:14.010
<i>The way I was before I vowed I'd never cry again...</i>

00:34:14.720 --> 00:34:19.220
<i>When I was so true to my feelings that I was almost foolish...</i>

00:34:27.230 --> 00:34:28.810
Are you all right?

00:34:55.720 --> 00:34:58.260
You've really held those tears back, haven't you?

00:35:03.180 --> 00:35:04.470
Here.

00:35:04.470 --> 00:35:05.540
Thank you.

00:35:05.540 --> 00:35:06.750
Bye now!

00:35:12.980 --> 00:35:18.070
<i>What I may need right now isn't to become stronger,</i>

00:35:18.070 --> 00:35:21.160
<i>but to recognize my own weakness.</i>

00:35:22.780 --> 00:35:24.700
<i>The me I used to hate...</i>

00:35:25.500 --> 00:35:29.980
<i>The weak me who couldn't even hide my own sadness...</i>

00:35:29.980 --> 00:35:32.920
<i>It might be time to finally allow that me back in.</i>

00:35:35.260 --> 00:35:38.130
<i>I know... I should go see Sora.</i>

00:35:40.010 --> 00:35:41.720
Ah, Ken, stop the car!

00:35:41.360 --> 00:35:42.410
Eh?

00:35:41.720 --> 00:35:43.010
Devil Brake!

00:36:08.370 --> 00:36:09.830
Layla-san!

00:36:15.800 --> 00:36:18.010
I finally found you.

00:36:19.630 --> 00:36:22.220
Sora...

00:36:22.220 --> 00:36:24.220
Why are you here...?

00:36:31.480 --> 00:36:33.020
Layla-san!

00:36:35.900 --> 00:36:37.860
Did you come searching for me?

00:36:37.840 --> 00:36:39.300
Yes...

00:36:39.300 --> 00:36:41.670
But er, uh...

00:36:43.160 --> 00:36:44.160
Thank you.

00:36:44.160 --> 00:36:46.760
You don't need to thank me at all!

00:36:46.760 --> 00:36:50.660
But that aside, y-y-your tears...

00:36:51.120 --> 00:36:52.370
My tears?

00:36:54.420 --> 00:36:56.920
Your timing was just too good, Sora.

00:36:58.420 --> 00:37:01.720
I'll be returning to Broadway now. Come with me.

00:37:01.720 --> 00:37:02.880
Yes.

00:37:02.880 --> 00:37:05.090
Ah, that's fine and all, but...

00:37:05.100 --> 00:37:06.760
Shouldn't you brush your tears away?

00:37:06.760 --> 00:37:09.470
It's fine. I don't want to.

00:37:11.730 --> 00:37:13.480
Now then, shall we go?

00:37:13.480 --> 00:37:14.850
Yes...

00:37:15.560 --> 00:37:18.480
We came here in Cathy-san's car.

00:37:18.480 --> 00:37:19.860
I'll go back by bike.

00:37:19.860 --> 00:37:22.530
Don't worry about it! You can ride in it! Right?

00:37:21.820 --> 00:37:23.900
It looks like she found what she was looking for...

00:37:22.530 --> 00:37:23.900
Yeah!

00:37:24.860 --> 00:37:28.510
If it's just May in the back then it should be
fine. Let's go back together, Layla-san!

00:37:28.510 --> 00:37:29.050
All right

00:37:29.050 --> 00:37:32.580
And so, a new trial...

00:37:32.580 --> 00:37:34.870
has begun!

00:37:49.810 --> 00:37:52.770
I've certainly made you all worry quite a bit.

00:37:52.770 --> 00:37:54.310
I'm truly sorry.

00:37:54.310 --> 00:37:55.600
Not at all.

00:37:58.520 --> 00:37:59.880
Thank you very much.

00:38:04.070 --> 00:38:08.870
I likely wanted to perform the phoenix due to my mother,

00:38:09.870 --> 00:38:13.120
She loved stories about the phoenix,

00:38:13.120 --> 00:38:16.290
and when I was still very young, she'd often read them to me.

00:38:17.210 --> 00:38:19.670
To my mother who had a weak body,

00:38:19.670 --> 00:38:23.630
she must've admired the phoenix who could
be reborn even after turning into ash.

00:38:24.920 --> 00:38:30.220
But in reality, she wasn't able to return like the phoenix.

00:38:31.720 --> 00:38:36.060
Even after she passed away, I'd read her books over again and again.

00:38:36.980 --> 00:38:41.900
At that time, what caught my eye was the phoenix
who would dive into the flames itself,

00:38:41.900 --> 00:38:46.590
and without relying on anyone else, be reborn.

00:38:47.160 --> 00:38:51.280
I strongly admired that figure of it.

00:38:51.280 --> 00:38:56.080
And eventually, I began to feel that I wanted to be the same.

00:38:56.080 --> 00:39:01.590
Which is why I thought a new me was right beyond that strength.

00:39:01.590 --> 00:39:06.380
But in truth, I've been supported by so many people.

00:39:06.380 --> 00:39:08.720
Like you, Sora... and everyone.

00:39:10.100 --> 00:39:11.510
Macquarie.

00:39:11.510 --> 00:39:12.430
Yes?

00:39:12.430 --> 00:39:16.560
The one who put those flowerpots of gloriosa
lilies in here was you, wasn't it?

00:39:18.400 --> 00:39:19.810
Yes...

00:39:20.230 --> 00:39:22.110
Gloriosa lilies?

00:39:22.110 --> 00:39:27.320
My mother loved them because they resembled a phoenix.

00:39:27.320 --> 00:39:31.950
After she passed away, whenever I'd stop and look around the house,

00:39:31.950 --> 00:39:34.240
there would always be at least one flowerpot of them.

00:39:34.830 --> 00:39:38.210
It felt as if my mother was still watching over me.

00:39:39.250 --> 00:39:47.210
And I felt like someone was cheering me on from
the shadows, and so it became my motivation.

00:39:49.010 --> 00:39:53.260
To realize only now... I really am slow.

00:39:53.260 --> 00:39:57.020
All of it was your doing, wasn't it, Macquarie?

00:39:57.430 --> 00:39:58.100
Yes.

00:39:59.140 --> 00:40:01.150
From back then all the way until today,

00:40:01.150 --> 00:40:05.770
I truly have been supported by you in a countless number of ways.

00:40:05.780 --> 00:40:06.880
Thank you.

00:40:06.880 --> 00:40:11.450
No, not at all! You don't need to thank me
 or anything... you really don't have to!

00:40:11.450 --> 00:40:14.200
Just hearing you say such kind things makes me happy!

00:40:16.970 --> 00:40:21.420
Now then, why don't you show us the vital fruit of your little journey?

00:40:21.420 --> 00:40:23.710
Yes, I suppose I should.

00:40:23.710 --> 00:40:24.710
Sora.

00:40:24.710 --> 00:40:25.710
Ah, yes?

00:40:26.550 --> 00:40:31.220
I have something I want to ask of you.

00:40:31.220 --> 00:40:33.010
Yes! What is it?

00:40:33.010 --> 00:40:34.570
Please ask for anything you want.

00:40:36.220 --> 00:40:38.560
What? Are you serious?

00:40:38.560 --> 00:40:41.520
Of course. I want you to do it.

00:40:41.520 --> 00:40:42.810
But...

00:40:42.810 --> 00:40:46.980
Please. I want you to change me by your hands.

00:40:49.860 --> 00:40:51.420
All right...

00:40:52.110 --> 00:40:54.200
We'll wait in the other room.

00:40:54.200 --> 00:40:55.910
Let's go. You two, as well.

00:40:55.910 --> 00:40:57.490
Okay!

00:41:03.170 --> 00:41:05.500
It's really all right for me to do this, right?

00:41:05.500 --> 00:41:06.790
Yes.

00:41:06.800 --> 00:41:08.960
Please give it a good trim.

00:41:09.630 --> 00:41:10.760
Okay.

00:41:29.110 --> 00:41:31.490
No. The audition is over.

00:41:31.490 --> 00:41:34.660
U-Umm, I have a reason as to why I was late!

00:41:34.660 --> 00:41:37.910
No matter what may have happened, a performance
onstage always starts according to schedule!

00:41:37.910 --> 00:41:39.280
But...

00:41:39.290 --> 00:41:40.450
Go home.

00:41:40.950 --> 00:41:43.460
Then why don't you show me?

00:41:43.460 --> 00:41:45.500
Your Golden Phoenix.

00:41:46.420 --> 00:41:51.090
Just to let you know, I don't acknowledge your presence here.

00:41:51.090 --> 00:41:53.260
All right. I'll do it.

00:41:53.260 --> 00:41:55.930
I will show you I can perform the Golden Phoenix!

00:41:57.260 --> 00:41:58.720
I'm amazed.

00:41:58.720 --> 00:42:04.230
You messed up at the very end, but that
truly was the Golden Phoenix just now.

00:42:04.230 --> 00:42:07.400
It looks like I have no choice but to accept you.

00:42:07.400 --> 00:42:11.230
I really... do love the Kaleido Stage!

00:42:11.230 --> 00:42:13.780
Please let me try once again!

00:42:13.780 --> 00:42:19.160
You owe a great deal to all of the audience
who came here to see us today.

00:42:19.160 --> 00:42:21.540
Show us your best show ever.

00:42:22.620 --> 00:42:24.060
Sora.

00:42:24.060 --> 00:42:25.480
Yes?

00:42:25.480 --> 00:42:30.500
Comparing myself now to myself before I met
you, I can see that I've changed quite a bit.

00:42:30.500 --> 00:42:31.880
You have, Layla-san?

00:42:31.880 --> 00:42:33.760
Yes.

00:42:33.760 --> 00:42:39.010
Whenever it was the time for me to grab
a hold of a new me, you were always there.

00:42:39.720 --> 00:42:41.970
You change me, Sora.

00:42:41.970 --> 00:42:44.700
No... not at all...

00:42:45.020 --> 00:42:51.110
Sora, that's why, out of all people, I wanted
you to be the one to cut my hair.

00:42:52.110 --> 00:43:00.950
I always relied only on you even though you
were already walking down a different path.

00:43:00.950 --> 00:43:06.120
And yet, I was still saved by your words.

00:43:06.120 --> 00:43:11.170
So... I thought I wanted to at least become of some strength to you...

00:43:11.170 --> 00:43:14.420
If it's my strength you want to add to,
 you've already given me so much.

00:43:16.300 --> 00:43:20.510
I'm truly happy to have met you.

00:43:22.100 --> 00:43:29.230
Out of all the people I've met in my life, I'm grateful
to you from the bottom of my heart, Sora.

00:43:33.360 --> 00:43:34.730
I'm done.

00:43:59.430 --> 00:44:00.470
It looks really good...

00:44:02.600 --> 00:44:04.970
Thank you, Sora.

00:44:07.020 --> 00:44:08.140
Sure.

00:44:09.520 --> 00:44:15.900
<i>Layla-san, to me, you really are someone special.</i>

00:44:15.900 --> 00:44:21.380
<i>Up until before I met you, I couldn't hold any confidence
in myself, and was so anxious and helpless,</i>

00:44:21.380 --> 00:44:23.910
<i>but now that's all like a lie...</i>

00:44:23.910 --> 00:44:26.760
<i>And right now, heat's welling up inside of me.</i>

00:44:34.090 --> 00:44:37.300
<i>I see... I just realized...</i>

00:44:37.800 --> 00:44:40.800
I can see flames in your eyes, Sora.

00:44:40.800 --> 00:44:43.220
You found your phoenix, haven't you?

00:44:46.430 --> 00:44:47.260
Yes!

00:44:48.430 --> 00:44:52.020
<i>The phoenix isn't something special.</i>

00:44:52.020 --> 00:44:55.610
<i>It's something that exists in everyone like wishes and dreams.</i>

00:44:55.610 --> 00:44:58.170
<i>The feelings of one day wanting to become like it.</i>

00:44:58.170 --> 00:45:00.380
<i>The emotions of the past that you want to return.</i>

00:45:02.820 --> 00:45:09.660
<i>No matter how many times it turns to ash, as long as
 we never give up on it, it'll always return with a blaze.</i>

00:45:09.660 --> 00:45:12.460
<i>It's our precious dreams.</i>

00:45:12.460 --> 00:45:19.170
<i>Right now, what's burning up inside of me
 are my feelings of longing towards you!</i>

00:45:20.550 --> 00:45:23.050
<i>My chest is burning up!</i>

00:45:23.050 --> 00:45:24.720
<i>Layla-san!</i>

00:45:27.220 --> 00:45:31.310
<i>I finally found it... my phoenix.</i>

00:45:32.350 --> 00:45:38.570
<i>In the climax of "Legend of Phoenix,'' with this feat...</i>

00:45:38.570 --> 00:45:40.110
<i>I will...</i>

00:45:41.190 --> 00:45:42.420
<i>...surpass Layla-san!</i>

00:45:42.420 --> 00:45:48.910
Leo drove away the darkness, and Sagittarius
 has regained her brilliance.

00:45:48.910 --> 00:45:54.160
These two constellations have just been reborn from the ashes!

00:45:54.140 --> 00:45:57.420
Yes, that's right! It's the Golden Phoenix!

00:45:57.420 --> 00:46:00.000
Yes! I'll amend the script right away!

00:46:00.010 --> 00:46:01.880
So Sora's feat has been decided!

00:46:01.880 --> 00:46:04.760
I wonder how she'll perform Layla-san's feat?

00:46:06.860 --> 00:46:08.800
Sora and the others are coming back today, you say?

00:46:08.810 --> 00:46:10.100
How does he know?

00:46:11.520 --> 00:46:13.350
He says it's animal intuition.

00:46:13.350 --> 00:46:14.440
Let's go and see!

00:46:16.060 --> 00:46:20.070
We have to... hurry up... and perfect this too!

00:46:20.070 --> 00:46:20.610
Yes!

00:46:20.610 --> 00:46:24.360
I'm really looking forward to Sora's Golden Phoenix!

00:46:25.030 --> 00:46:27.610
Could you please do that outside?

00:46:28.530 --> 00:46:30.370
Ah, they're really coming back!

00:46:30.370 --> 00:46:31.700
Okay, stop the car!

00:46:31.700 --> 00:46:35.620
Were going to start training right away! Our
enemy this time is the Golden Phoenix!

00:46:36.750 --> 00:46:39.080
Then, I'm going to go talk to Mia.

00:46:39.090 --> 00:46:39.900
Okay.

00:46:40.130 --> 00:46:41.550
Ah, Ken.

00:46:42.170 --> 00:46:44.970
Ken, you said so before, didn't you?

00:46:44.970 --> 00:46:48.470
That becoming part of the cast here was
a dream you had since you were a child.

00:46:48.470 --> 00:46:54.100
But, when you stood onstage as a clown,
I really thought you were full of life.

00:46:54.100 --> 00:46:57.870
Is your dream really still ash?

00:46:58.650 --> 00:47:02.150
If it's not, then let's perform together in this show.

00:47:03.230 --> 00:47:04.840
Thank you, Sora.

00:47:04.840 --> 00:47:06.360
But, it's all right.

00:47:06.360 --> 00:47:07.530
Really?

00:47:07.530 --> 00:47:11.910
Yeah. If it's my dream you're worried about, it's still burning brightly.

00:47:11.910 --> 00:47:14.500
Even right now, before my very eyes.

00:47:18.500 --> 00:47:19.630
Yeah!

00:47:27.760 --> 00:47:41.860
<i>The kindness I rely upon from others will surely change me.</i>

00:47:27.760 --> 00:47:41.860
<i>dareka ni tayori yasashisa wa kitto watashi wo kaete kureru</i>

00:47:41.860 --> 00:47:56.080
<i>The strictness in two people facing one another is born into new strength.</i>

00:47:41.860 --> 00:47:56.080
<i>mukiau koto ni kibishisa wa umidasu chikara ni naru wa</i>

00:47:56.080 --> 00:48:09.630
<i>To bring no shame to the future me I will meet one day, I'm living now.</i>

00:47:56.080 --> 00:48:09.630
<i>itsuka deau asu no jibun ni hajinai you ni ima wo ikiru</i>

00:48:09.630 --> 00:48:24.400
<i>And I always will be, as to not freeze my heart.</i>

00:48:09.630 --> 00:48:24.400
<i>haato wo koorenai you ni itsudatte kitto</i>

00:48:26.610 --> 00:48:42.250
<i>I will continue to believe in the reason for these feelings in my chest.</i>

00:48:26.610 --> 00:48:42.250
<i>dakara mune no omoi no wake shinjitsuzukeru</i>

00:48:42.250 --> 00:48:57.510
<i>Even if it's an uncool way of living, I'll make it shine over and over again.</i>

00:48:42.250 --> 00:48:57.510
<i>kakkouwarui ikikata demo kagayakaseru wa nando demo</i>

00:49:09.070 --> 00:49:26.210
<i>Embracing my heart, I will fly up and away over and over again.</i>

00:49:09.070 --> 00:49:26.210
<i>kokoro fui ni dakasete habataite yuku nando demo</i>

00:50:00.830 --> 00:50:04.480
I was finally able to come here together with you, Father...

00:50:04.480 --> 00:50:05.940
Yes...

00:50:05.940 --> 00:50:08.130
This would make the first day since the funeral, huh?

00:50:09.630 --> 00:50:12.630
I saw your show yesterday.

00:50:12.630 --> 00:50:16.140
It reminded me of the days when Rola was still alive.

00:50:16.140 --> 00:50:19.990
I... was a crybaby back then.

00:50:19.990 --> 00:50:22.240
Yes...

00:50:36.280 --> 00:50:41.410
Our wings are our dreams, which carry us to the sky!
